    description: "cohort recurses into sub-collections but stores bare repo names; run then resolves <pool>/<name> at the top level, so a repo living in a sub-collection (e.g. webtunnel under ~/ALL_REPOS) yields FileNotFoundError. Worked around in R0 by using a flat pool (~/ALL_REPOS/repos_Apr12_2026). RE-FILED from the R0 lab notebook after the original (WI-durub-zuvib-zunuz-tiraj-mufag-norim-hadif-jufuh) was lost to the auto-pr untracked-ops data-loss bug. Detected during correctness-campaign R0."  # 10bc
